--- Client-side hooks of the plugin. Hooks are handled by gamemode-like functions on the
-- plugin's global instead of hook.Add.

--- Greets the local player once their client has finished loading, unless the
-- `{{id}}_greeting` config is off.
function {{global}}:PlayerInitialized()
  if !Config.get('{{id}}_greeting') then return end

  PLAYER:notify('notification.{{id}}.greeting')
end
